                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 638.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Translation from the Sabah of October 5.</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The kindness and gracious treatment shown the students (softas) by his imperial
                    majesty the caliph is approved by the universe, and is seen by the eyes of
                    gratitude and of praise to be every moment covered with glory. As a part of the
                    great and beautiful sum of these kindnesses and upon the firman of His Majesty
                    (the shadow of God) the chief carpet spreader of His Imperial Majesty, His
                    Excellency Izzet Bey, went yesterday to the region of Sultan Beyezid and
                    distributed to certain medrepes (theological schools) in that region 11 sheep
                    for sacrifice and a sufficient amount of the Imperial bounty.</p>
                <p>It has also come to the ears of our thanksgiving that prayers from all for the
                    well being of His Majesty, the builder of the world, ascended to the throne of
                    the Almighty Supplier of Needs.</p>
            </div>
